[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0010","text":"……雏菜，之前呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0020","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0030","text":"戴着猫耳和尾巴，拍了杂志的写真～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0040","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0050","text":"那时候，摄影师跟我说……\n让我说“喵～”～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0060","text":"嘿——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0065","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0070","text":"说是……\n想要“跃动感”？　什么的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0080","text":"……跃动感"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0090","text":"哈～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300200_02_0100","text":"…………好困"}]
